#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: ruvelo-editorial.php
msgid "Ruvelo Editorial"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: ruvelo-editorial.php
msgid "https://ruvelo.github.io/wp-editorial/"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: ruvelo-editorial.php
msgid "Review and approval on top of core Notes: ask for a review, approve or request changes, see what waits for you, and optionally hold publishing until a post is approved."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: ruvelo-editorial.php
msgid "Ruvelo"
msgstr ""

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: ruvelo-editorial.php
msgid "https://github.com/Ruvelo"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:32
msgid "Editorial reviews"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:33
msgid "Review states, the review queue, approvals and change requests."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:46
msgid "Get a post’s review state"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:47
msgid "Returns where a post is in review: Not in review, In review, Changes requested or Approved; its reviewers and their decisions; approvals so far and needed; open core notes; the due date; whether its publish gate is satisfied; and the review history."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:57
msgid "Get the review queue"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:58
msgid "Lists posts in the current user’s review queue. Views: mine (waiting for my review), changes (changes requested on my posts), approved (approved and ready to publish), all (everything in review)."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:77
#: src/Admin/ReviewPage.php:151
#: src/Admin/ReviewPage.php:167
msgid "Ask for a review"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:78
msgid "Asks reviewers (user IDs) to review a post, with an optional due date (Y-m-d) and message. On a post already in review it changes the reviewers; after changes were requested it starts a new round. Needs edit access to the post."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:97
msgid "Approve a post"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:98
msgid "Approves a post as the current user, who must be one of its reviewers and have the ruvelo_review_posts capability. With enough approvals the post becomes Approved."
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:113
msgid "Request changes on a post"
msgstr ""

#: src/Abilities.php:114
msgid "Sends a post back to its author with a message, as the current user (one of its reviewers, with the ruvelo_review_posts capability). Set create_note to also leave the message as a core note on the post."
msgstr ""

